Navigating the menus

When you open History Tracers, the main content appears in the center of the screen. On the left side, you will find the sidebar with all the menus.

Click the menu button at the top-left corner to show or hide the sidebar. On wide screens you can hide it to give more space to the content. You can also close the menu by clicking anywhere on the text.

On mobile devices, tap the button to open the sidebar and tap it again to close it.

Each menu has a title and a list of options. Click any option to open that page. The sidebar stays visible so you can keep navigating. Use your browser back and forward buttons to return to previous pages.

Some content spans several chapters. A navigation bar at the bottom helps you move between them.

